# Privacy notice

Last updated 22 November 2026

## Who we are

The Civica Design System is an open-source, community-driven project. It provides design guidance, documentation and supporting assets, including the Civica Home Assistant theme and custom dashboard cards.

GitHub Pages hosts this website. The source code for the design system, theme and assets is kept in public GitHub repositories.

Civica is an open-source community project. It is not a registered company or a public authority, so it has no Data Protection Officer and no registration with the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO).

## What data we collect

This website is a static documentation site. We do not collect, store or process personal data through user accounts, contact forms or analytics trackers.

When you visit this website, your browser connects directly to GitHub Pages to load the pages and files. As part of standard web hosting, GitHub may process technical connection data in its server logs to deliver the site securely and reliably. This includes your IP address, browser type and the time of your request.

## If you interact with us on GitHub

If you raise an issue, submit a pull request or join a discussion in our GitHub repositories, your profile information, comments and code contributions are handled through your GitHub account. They become publicly visible, in line with your GitHub settings.

## Cookies and local storage

The site saves one essential cookie, only when you hide the first-visit notice. We do not use tracking, advertising or third-party analytics cookies. Read the [Cookies page](cookies.html) for what the cookie contains and how to remove it.

## Why we process technical data

Where our hosting provider processes technical connection data, it is used only to:

* serve the website pages, stylesheets and documentation to your browser
* keep the site secure, stable and available

We do not use your information for marketing, profiling or commercial purposes. We do not sell personal data or share it with other organisations.

## Third-party services and international transfers

We do not send personal data to third-party services when designing, building or running this website. Design references, mood boards and inspiration are created and stored locally, without personal data.

GitHub, Inc. handles the technical delivery of the site. Read the [GitHub Privacy Statement](https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement) to find out how GitHub handles visitor data.

## Open-source licensing

The Civica Design System, the Civica Home Assistant theme and the supporting custom card assets are released under open-source licences. Read the [Licence page](licence.html) for the terms, or browse the [Civica repository on GitHub](https://github.com/nathcymru/civica).

## How to contact us

If you have questions about this privacy notice or how the project runs, open an issue or start a discussion in the [Civica repository on GitHub](https://github.com/nathcymru/civica).

## Changes to this notice

We may update this notice if the way the website is hosted or built changes. Updates are published on this page with a new "Last updated" date. Every change is also recorded in our public GitHub commit history.
